# The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl: entering makes a Squirrel (her own creature type counts, so Bot1 controls two), and
# "{1}{G}{G}{G}: Create X 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens, where X is the number of Squirrels you control" then makes
# exactly two more - Bot2's own Squirrel Girl and token are not "you control" (X would be 4). The cost needs three green
# sources: Forest, Forest, Jet and Pearl give only two, so it is refused until Mox Emerald is out, then paid with exactly
# four mana. Attacking makes one more Squirrel. Bot1 ends with Squirrel Girl and 4 tokens; Bot2 with her and 1 token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Forest
Forest
The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl.Activate(Ability: Create X; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl.Activate(Ability: Create X)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 10
Bot1.Battlefield.Squirrel Token#1.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Squirrel Token#1.Subtypes = Squirrel
Bot1.Battlefield.Squirrel Token#1.Types = Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Squirrel Token#1.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Squirrel Token#1.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot2.Life = 16
